WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.415 --> 00:00:03.566
- And the reason some people
don't enjoy their lives,

00:00:03.566 --> 00:00:06.577
is because their container, their heart,

00:00:06.577 --> 00:00:09.113
is contaminated with so many things.

00:00:09.113 --> 00:00:13.280
Are you flying solo or do you
have a community of faith?

00:00:14.165 --> 00:00:16.720
People flying with you watching over you,

00:00:16.720 --> 00:00:18.707
encouraging you, inspiring you.

00:00:18.707 --> 00:00:21.540
If you're always feeding
negative thoughts,

00:00:21.540 --> 00:00:23.197
thinking I'll never get well,

00:00:23.197 --> 00:00:24.987
I'll never meet the right person,

00:00:24.987 --> 00:00:29.397
you're feeding doubt, feeding
mediocrity, feeding fear.

00:00:29.397 --> 00:00:31.433
- Hello Believe Nation, my
name is Evan Carmichael,

00:00:31.433 --> 00:00:34.168
my one word is believe, and
I believe that entrepreneurs

00:00:34.168 --> 00:00:37.034
will solve all of the
world's major problems.

00:00:37.034 --> 00:00:38.101
So to help you on your journey,

00:00:38.101 --> 00:00:39.917
today we're going to learn from pastor

00:00:39.917 --> 00:00:43.269
and New York Times best
selling author, Joel Osteen,

00:00:43.269 --> 00:00:46.873
and my take on his Top 10
Rules for Success, Volume Two.

00:00:46.873 --> 00:00:48.928
Rule number five is my personal favorite

00:00:48.928 --> 00:00:51.474
and I'd love to know which
one you guys like the best.

00:00:51.474 --> 00:00:52.887
And as always, as you're watching

00:00:52.887 --> 00:00:55.120
if you hear something that
really resonates with you,

00:00:55.120 --> 00:00:56.524
please leave it the comments below,

00:00:56.524 --> 00:00:58.992
put quotes around it so
other people can be inspired,

00:00:58.992 --> 00:01:00.870
might win a prize as well,

00:01:00.870 --> 00:01:02.160
and also when you write it down,

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:05.170
it's much more likely to
stick for yourself as well.

00:01:05.170 --> 00:01:06.003
Enjoy.

00:01:09.439 --> 00:01:12.189
(dramatic music)

00:01:19.370 --> 00:01:21.246
- It's easy to go through life holding on

00:01:21.246 --> 00:01:23.609
to things that are weighing us down,

00:01:23.609 --> 00:01:26.276
guilt, resentment, doubt, worry.

00:01:27.334 --> 00:01:30.672
The problem is when we
allow these things in,

00:01:30.672 --> 00:01:32.927
they're taking up space
for the good things

00:01:32.927 --> 00:01:34.740
that should be there.

00:01:34.740 --> 00:01:37.658
Imagine your life is like a container.

00:01:37.658 --> 00:01:40.609
You were created to be filled with joy,

00:01:40.609 --> 00:01:43.223
peace, confidence, creativity,

00:01:43.223 --> 00:01:47.496
but if you allow worry in,
it pushes out the peace.

00:01:47.496 --> 00:01:49.411
There's not space for both.

00:01:49.411 --> 00:01:51.708
You can't go above 100%.

00:01:51.708 --> 00:01:54.038
You have a limited amount of room.

00:01:54.038 --> 00:01:56.821
If you allow guilt to take up space,

00:01:56.821 --> 00:01:58.757
that's space that you don't have

00:01:58.757 --> 00:02:00.756
for the confidence you need.

00:02:00.756 --> 00:02:04.106
And the reason some people
don't enjoy their lives,

00:02:04.106 --> 00:02:07.077
is because their container, their heart

00:02:07.077 --> 00:02:09.926
is contaminated with so many things.

00:02:09.926 --> 00:02:13.631
They have 10% worried,
stressed out over their job,

00:02:13.631 --> 00:02:16.543
12% bitterness, mad at their neighbor,

00:02:16.543 --> 00:02:20.626
20% guilt, beating themselves
up for past mistakes,

00:02:20.626 --> 00:02:24.101
9% jealousy, their
co-worker is more beautiful.

00:02:24.101 --> 00:02:28.937
They don't realize 70% of
their container is negative.

00:02:28.937 --> 00:02:30.465
They wonder why they don't have joy,

00:02:30.465 --> 00:02:33.684
creativity, passion, they only have room

00:02:33.684 --> 00:02:36.600
for 30% of what they should have.

00:02:36.600 --> 00:02:40.613
And the scripture says
give no place to the enemy.

00:02:40.613 --> 00:02:42.921
It's not just talking
about forces of darkness,

00:02:42.921 --> 00:02:46.069
that means give no place to guilt,

00:02:46.069 --> 00:02:49.791
give no place to worry,
give no place to bitterness.

00:02:49.791 --> 00:02:52.758
It can't come in and
automatically take over.

00:02:52.758 --> 00:02:55.854
You control what's in your container.

00:02:55.854 --> 00:02:57.711
You control what you think about,

00:02:57.711 --> 00:03:00.980
what you choose to allow
in, and we all have

00:03:00.980 --> 00:03:03.991
negative emotions, negative feelings.

00:03:03.991 --> 00:03:07.071
You have to make the choice,
I'm not going to give

00:03:07.071 --> 00:03:10.362
this jealousy, this bitterness, this anger

00:03:10.362 --> 00:03:13.947
valuable space and let it poison my life.

00:03:13.947 --> 00:03:16.885
I'm going to protect what I allow in me.

00:03:16.885 --> 00:03:18.793
And every morning when we wake up,

00:03:18.793 --> 00:03:22.674
we need to empty out anything
negative from the day before.

00:03:22.674 --> 00:03:26.121
Somebody offended you at work,
they didn't treat you right,

00:03:26.121 --> 00:03:28.687
it's easy to let that offense stay.

00:03:28.687 --> 00:03:30.866
Feels good to carry around a grudge,

00:03:30.866 --> 00:03:33.074
but you have to be disciplined, say no

00:03:33.074 --> 00:03:35.929
I am giving this offense any room.

00:03:35.929 --> 00:03:38.686
I am not going to let it sour my day.

00:03:38.686 --> 00:03:42.940
They hurt you once, don't
let them continue to hurt you

00:03:42.940 --> 00:03:45.238
by holding on to the offense.

00:03:45.238 --> 00:03:48.983
Being offended is not harming
them, it's harming you.

00:03:48.983 --> 00:03:52.008
It's taking up space you
need for the good things

00:03:52.008 --> 00:03:54.145
that move you towards your destiny.

00:03:54.145 --> 00:03:58.148
Take inventory of what
you're giving space to.

00:03:58.148 --> 00:04:00.219
Life is too short to go through it

00:04:00.219 --> 00:04:03.030
with negative things holding us down.

00:04:03.030 --> 00:04:06.091
There's a large company
that has a slogan that says,

00:04:06.091 --> 00:04:07.462
That was easy.

00:04:07.462 --> 00:04:09.498
A few years ago a friend of mine

00:04:09.498 --> 00:04:13.547
sent me their big red button
when you push it says,

00:04:13.547 --> 00:04:14.924
- [Button] That was easy.

00:04:14.924 --> 00:04:15.757
(audience laughs)

00:04:15.757 --> 00:04:19.433
- I keep this by my bathroom
sink there on the counter.

00:04:19.433 --> 00:04:22.821
Every so often, I reach
over and push this button.

00:04:22.821 --> 00:04:26.324
I like to get that
phrase down in my spirit.

00:04:26.324 --> 00:04:27.841
'Cause it's easy to go through life,

00:04:27.841 --> 00:04:31.485
looking at our problems,
focused on our obstacles,

00:04:31.485 --> 00:04:33.805
thinking aw man, this is goin' be so hard.

00:04:33.805 --> 00:04:37.100
I dread dealing with this,
it's never going to work out.

00:04:37.100 --> 00:04:40.524
That mindset is not only stealing our joy,

00:04:40.524 --> 00:04:43.640
but it's keeping us
from seeing God's favor.

00:04:43.640 --> 00:04:45.645
When my dad went to be with the Lord and

00:04:45.645 --> 00:04:49.616
I first started ministering,
it took everything I had

00:04:49.616 --> 00:04:51.762
to write a message for that weekend,

00:04:51.762 --> 00:04:55.720
all my focus, my creativity, my energy.

00:04:55.720 --> 00:04:58.688
I was pressured, stressed.

00:04:58.688 --> 00:05:00.367
When I finally finished I felt like

00:05:00.367 --> 00:05:03.256
that's the last one that I could ever do.

00:05:03.256 --> 00:05:06.783
And if I wasn't careful,
I was tempted to dread it

00:05:06.783 --> 00:05:08.594
and think this is too hard,

00:05:08.594 --> 00:05:11.671
I'm not going to know what to
say, I can't do this anymore.

00:05:11.671 --> 00:05:13.825
I had to turn it around.

00:05:13.825 --> 00:05:16.581
Father thank you that your yolk is easy.

00:05:16.581 --> 00:05:18.316
Thank you that I'm well able,

00:05:18.316 --> 00:05:21.543
thank you that you've
equipped me and empowered me.

00:05:21.543 --> 00:05:25.128
I got my mind going in
the right direction.

00:05:25.128 --> 00:05:27.693
I went through seasons
of struggle, strain,

00:05:27.693 --> 00:05:29.867
difficulty, but I didn't let it

00:05:29.867 --> 00:05:32.501
become permanent in my thinking.

00:05:32.501 --> 00:05:35.876
One day I came into
this anointing of ease.

00:05:35.876 --> 00:05:40.023
What once was a struggle,
is not a struggle anymore.

00:05:40.023 --> 00:05:41.377
Every week when I finish a message,

00:05:41.377 --> 00:05:42.583
I hit this button,

00:05:42.583 --> 00:05:43.556
- [Button] That was easy.

00:05:43.556 --> 00:05:46.642
- just to remind me that it was easy.

00:05:46.642 --> 00:05:49.914
Quit telling yourself, this is so hard,

00:05:49.914 --> 00:05:51.574
I'll never accomplish my dreams,

00:05:51.574 --> 00:05:53.289
I'll never get out of debt.

00:05:53.289 --> 00:05:55.277
This is a new day.

00:05:55.277 --> 00:05:56.967
It's easy to do life on our own,

00:05:56.967 --> 00:05:59.140
and think we don't need any help,

00:05:59.140 --> 00:06:03.056
but you won't reach your
highest potential by yourself.

00:06:03.056 --> 00:06:06.346
God has ordained people
to come into your life

00:06:06.346 --> 00:06:08.644
to strengthen you, to encourage you,

00:06:08.644 --> 00:06:11.282
to push you towards your purpose.

00:06:11.282 --> 00:06:14.332
You've seen birds that fly in formation.

00:06:14.332 --> 00:06:16.980
When geese make that V, it takes

00:06:16.980 --> 00:06:20.825
40% less energy for them to fly.

00:06:20.825 --> 00:06:22.882
They could do it by themselves,

00:06:22.882 --> 00:06:25.175
but they understand this principle

00:06:25.175 --> 00:06:28.716
they won't go as far if they fly solo.

00:06:28.716 --> 00:06:32.883
Are you flying solo or do you
have a community of faith?

00:06:33.772 --> 00:06:36.272
People flying with you, watching over you,

00:06:36.272 --> 00:06:38.800
encouraging you, inspiring you.

00:06:38.800 --> 00:06:40.877
After the football game the other night,

00:06:40.877 --> 00:06:43.452
the star running back
was being interviewed

00:06:43.452 --> 00:06:45.978
and he'd had a great game, set a record

00:06:45.978 --> 00:06:48.212
for the amount of yards he had rushed.

00:06:48.212 --> 00:06:50.354
The reporter asked him how he did it.

00:06:50.354 --> 00:06:52.663
The first thing he said was

00:06:52.663 --> 00:06:55.087
it was because of my offensive line.

00:06:55.087 --> 00:06:57.897
Those guys that block
for me, they're the best.

00:06:57.897 --> 00:07:01.111
And my coaches have poured
into me and made me better.

00:07:01.111 --> 00:07:03.482
My trainers have helped
me to get stronger.

00:07:03.482 --> 00:07:07.077
He recognized that we need each other.

00:07:07.077 --> 00:07:09.640
You can be good by yourself,

00:07:09.640 --> 00:07:12.481
but you can't be great by yourself.

00:07:12.481 --> 00:07:15.415
You won't become all
you were created to be

00:07:15.415 --> 00:07:17.943
without the right people around you.

00:07:17.943 --> 00:07:22.481
You can go 60% but when
you get in formation,

00:07:22.481 --> 00:07:25.404
when you have a family of
faith blocking for you,

00:07:25.404 --> 00:07:29.533
praying for you, encouraging
you, you'll go 40% further.

00:07:29.533 --> 00:07:32.083
Too often, we base our value

00:07:32.083 --> 00:07:35.705
on how someone is treating
us or how successful we are

00:07:35.705 --> 00:07:38.764
or how perfect of a life we've lived.

00:07:38.764 --> 00:07:42.500
The problem is all of
those things can change.

00:07:42.500 --> 00:07:46.365
If you're getting your value
out of how people treat you,

00:07:46.365 --> 00:07:49.205
then if they hurt, they disappoint you,

00:07:49.205 --> 00:07:51.742
you're going to feel devalued.

00:07:51.742 --> 00:07:55.371
If you're basing your value
off of your achievements,

00:07:55.371 --> 00:07:57.497
how much you make, what you drive,

00:07:57.497 --> 00:08:00.953
the title behind your name,
then if something happens

00:08:00.953 --> 00:08:02.854
and you don't have that position,

00:08:02.854 --> 00:08:06.947
your business goes down,
then your value will go down.

00:08:06.947 --> 00:08:10.191
And some people don't
feel good about themselves

00:08:10.191 --> 00:08:12.023
'cause they've made mistakes in life.

00:08:12.023 --> 00:08:14.259
They're not where they
thought they would be.

00:08:14.259 --> 00:08:17.745
Now they're living
insecure, feeling inferior,

00:08:17.745 --> 00:08:21.056
they're basing their value
on their performance.

00:08:21.056 --> 00:08:24.806
How someone treats you
doesn't change your value.

00:08:24.806 --> 00:08:28.724
What they say or do
doesn't lessen who you are.

00:08:28.724 --> 00:08:32.803
Mistakes you've made
doesn't decrease your value.

00:08:32.803 --> 00:08:36.301
That's what you did,
that's not who you are.

00:08:36.301 --> 00:08:39.600
You can buy a bigger
house, drive a better car,

00:08:39.600 --> 00:08:42.686
but that doesn't make
you any more valuable.

00:08:42.686 --> 00:08:46.794
That increases your net
worth, not your self worth.

00:08:46.794 --> 00:08:50.652
You were already valuable when
you had the small apartment

00:08:50.652 --> 00:08:52.713
and no title behind your name.

00:08:52.713 --> 00:08:56.002
That position may give you more influence,

00:08:56.002 --> 00:08:57.989
but not more value.

00:08:57.989 --> 00:09:01.813
You can be a stay at home
mom, raising your children.

00:09:01.813 --> 00:09:05.062
You may not have the influence of the CEO,

00:09:05.062 --> 00:09:07.365
but you have the same value.

00:09:07.365 --> 00:09:09.832
Value is not based on what you do,

00:09:09.832 --> 00:09:13.012
what you make, who you
know, that's superficial,

00:09:13.012 --> 00:09:14.399
those things can change.

00:09:14.399 --> 00:09:18.963
The enemy works overtime
trying to devalue us.

00:09:18.963 --> 00:09:20.925
He'd love for you to go through life

00:09:20.925 --> 00:09:24.616
letting what people say
make you feel inferior.

00:09:24.616 --> 00:09:27.425
Comparing your life to somebody else's,

00:09:27.425 --> 00:09:30.328
thinking you'll feel good about yourself

00:09:30.328 --> 00:09:32.343
when you catch up to them.

00:09:32.343 --> 00:09:34.093
When you live in that neighborhood.

00:09:34.093 --> 00:09:37.183
Or when you perform perfectly,

00:09:37.183 --> 00:09:40.463
when you break the addiction,
then you'll feel valuable.

00:09:40.463 --> 00:09:44.498
But nothing you do will
make you any more valuable.

00:09:44.498 --> 00:09:47.559
Nothing you achieve, nothing you overcome,

00:09:47.559 --> 00:09:50.206
you are valuable right now.

00:09:50.206 --> 00:09:55.052
God calls you a masterpiece,
you are one of a kind.

00:09:55.052 --> 00:09:57.279
You didn't come off an assembly line,

00:09:57.279 --> 00:09:59.068
you weren't massed produced.

00:09:59.068 --> 00:10:03.038
God made you unique, there
will never be another you.

00:10:03.038 --> 00:10:04.635
Put your shoulders back,

00:10:04.635 --> 00:10:06.838
start carrying yourself with confidence.

00:10:06.838 --> 00:10:10.192
You have been fearfully
and wonderfully made.

00:10:10.192 --> 00:10:14.378
We may not realize it, but
we're always feeding ourselves.

00:10:14.378 --> 00:10:18.051
What we watch and listen
to, the people we're around

00:10:18.051 --> 00:10:19.827
the thoughts we're dwelling on,

00:10:19.827 --> 00:10:22.388
that's feeding our inner man.

00:10:22.388 --> 00:10:24.225
If you go to lunch with people,

00:10:24.225 --> 00:10:27.819
that talk bad about the boss,
make fun of a co-worker,

00:10:27.819 --> 00:10:30.865
put down a friend, they're
feeding you gossip,

00:10:30.865 --> 00:10:33.968
feeding you jealousy,
feeding you disrespect.

00:10:33.968 --> 00:10:38.361
Here's the key, whatever
you feed, is going to grow.

00:10:38.361 --> 00:10:40.650
You may not like what they're feeding you,

00:10:40.650 --> 00:10:43.370
you're a nice person, but if you continue

00:10:43.370 --> 00:10:45.576
to hang around them, before long,

00:10:45.576 --> 00:10:47.770
you'll be gossiping, you'll be critical,

00:10:47.770 --> 00:10:49.993
you'll be disrespectful, why?

00:10:49.993 --> 00:10:53.397
Because you kept feeding the wrong things.

00:10:53.397 --> 00:10:56.155
If you're always feeding
negative thoughts,

00:10:56.155 --> 00:10:58.104
thinking I'll never get well,

00:10:58.104 --> 00:10:59.898
I'll never meet the right person,

00:10:59.898 --> 00:11:04.320
you're feeding doubt, feeding
mediocrity, feeding fear.

00:11:04.320 --> 00:11:07.721
A man told me how he
spent years of his life

00:11:07.721 --> 00:11:11.140
on drugs and alcohol and
it had ruined his marriage.

00:11:11.140 --> 00:11:13.266
He wasn't there for his children.

00:11:13.266 --> 00:11:16.498
Now he was so down on
himself, so discouraged.

00:11:16.498 --> 00:11:17.576
What was he doing?

00:11:17.576 --> 00:11:21.516
Feeding the guilt, feeding
the regret, feeding the blame.

00:11:21.516 --> 00:11:24.951
If you feed guilt, it's
going to get bigger.

00:11:24.951 --> 00:11:28.671
If you feed fear, it's
going to become larger.

00:11:28.671 --> 00:11:31.504
What if you spent that same energy

00:11:31.504 --> 00:11:35.809
feeding your faith, feeding
your hopes, feeding your dreams.

00:11:35.809 --> 00:11:38.409
What are you allowing in your spirit?

00:11:38.409 --> 00:11:40.320
The people you're spending time with,

00:11:40.320 --> 00:11:42.241
the thoughts you're dwelling on all day,

00:11:42.241 --> 00:11:45.824
is that inspiring you,
building your faith,

00:11:45.824 --> 00:11:47.792
pushing you towards your dreams?

00:11:47.792 --> 00:11:51.707
Or is it junk food, feeding
you guilt, mediocrity,

00:11:51.707 --> 00:11:55.157
negativity, causing you to compromise.

00:11:55.157 --> 00:11:58.613
A friend of mine was diagnosed
with a serious illness.

00:11:58.613 --> 00:12:01.402
The doctor put him on a very strict diet.

00:12:01.402 --> 00:12:04.183
He couldn't eat any sugar, any flour,

00:12:04.183 --> 00:12:07.024
any meat, it was only raw vegetables,

00:12:07.024 --> 00:12:09.612
nuts, grains, very limited.

00:12:09.612 --> 00:12:12.327
Now I asked him if he was going to do it.

00:12:12.327 --> 00:12:14.365
He said, what do mean am I going to do it?

00:12:14.365 --> 00:12:18.088
I don't have a choice,
my life depends on it.

00:12:18.088 --> 00:12:20.867
Today I'm putting you on a new diet.

00:12:20.867 --> 00:12:23.623
Not physically, but for your inner man.

00:12:23.623 --> 00:12:25.396
No more junk food.

00:12:25.396 --> 00:12:27.995
No more dwelling on thoughts of worry,

00:12:27.995 --> 00:12:31.275
fear, I don't have what it takes.

00:12:31.275 --> 00:12:34.254
No more hanging around
people that are feeding you

00:12:34.254 --> 00:12:37.310
negativity, causing you to compromise.

00:12:37.310 --> 00:12:40.832
No more guilt, condemnation,
I'm all washed up.

00:12:40.832 --> 00:12:44.349
You're prescription is for faith food.

00:12:44.349 --> 00:12:46.753
Feed your hopes, feed your dreams,

00:12:46.753 --> 00:12:50.059
feed your confidence, feed your destiny.

00:12:50.059 --> 00:12:51.648
It's easy to have faith.

00:12:51.648 --> 00:12:53.918
It's easy to believe for your dreams,

00:12:53.918 --> 00:12:58.264
but faith without patience
can get you into trouble.

00:12:58.264 --> 00:13:00.144
What you're believing for may be

00:13:00.144 --> 00:13:02.394
taking longer than you thought.

00:13:02.394 --> 00:13:06.432
You're not making progress, not
seeing a dream come to pass,

00:13:06.432 --> 00:13:09.313
but God knows what he's doing.

00:13:09.313 --> 00:13:12.068
Don't try to force things to happen,

00:13:12.068 --> 00:13:16.152
you don't have to promote
yourself, manipulate people,

00:13:16.152 --> 00:13:18.202
convince them to like you.

00:13:18.202 --> 00:13:20.394
Yes we should be determined,

00:13:20.394 --> 00:13:23.048
but you don't have to beat down a door.

00:13:23.048 --> 00:13:26.697
At the right time, things
will fall into place.

00:13:26.697 --> 00:13:30.498
At the right time, the
right people will show up.

00:13:30.498 --> 00:13:35.021
Now do your part and wait
for the promise to unfold.

00:13:35.021 --> 00:13:38.945
You're not falling behind,
you're not being left out,

00:13:38.945 --> 00:13:40.721
you're right on schedule.

00:13:40.721 --> 00:13:43.316
When we've been believing for
our dreams to come to pass

00:13:43.316 --> 00:13:46.857
for a long time or
problems to turn around and

00:13:46.857 --> 00:13:49.346
we don't see anything happening,

00:13:49.346 --> 00:13:50.739
we're not making progress,

00:13:50.739 --> 00:13:52.744
we're not getting good breaks,

00:13:52.744 --> 00:13:54.850
it's easy to lose our passion

00:13:54.850 --> 00:13:57.339
and not expect things to change.

00:13:57.339 --> 00:14:00.776
It's been that way so long,
we start accepting it.

00:14:00.776 --> 00:14:04.263
I'll never get well, I'll
never break this addiction.

00:14:04.263 --> 00:14:06.211
I'll never accomplish my goals.

00:14:06.211 --> 00:14:09.820
I tried, I prayed, I believed,
but it didn't work out.

00:14:09.820 --> 00:14:12.283
That may have been true in the past,

00:14:12.283 --> 00:14:16.022
but I believe you are
entering into a new season.

00:14:16.022 --> 00:14:19.096
You're coming in to a high time.

00:14:19.096 --> 00:14:23.459
High time is when things
suddenly change in your favor.

00:14:23.459 --> 00:14:26.869
High time is when
blessings chase you down.

00:14:26.869 --> 00:14:30.145
You don't have to go after
them, they come after you.

00:14:30.145 --> 00:14:33.476
High time is when you're healing shows up.

00:14:33.476 --> 00:14:36.106
You meet the right person,
you break the addiction.

00:14:36.106 --> 00:14:39.972
God makes things happen that
you couldn't make happen.

00:14:39.972 --> 00:14:42.781
Now if you're going to see this high time,

00:14:42.781 --> 00:14:46.756
there's something you have to
do, wake up out of your sleep.

00:14:46.756 --> 00:14:49.525
That means get your passion back.

00:14:49.525 --> 00:14:53.505
Start believing again, start
expecting things to change,

00:14:53.505 --> 00:14:56.448
start talking like it's going to happen.

00:14:56.448 --> 00:15:00.958
You can't sleep through your
high time and see God's favor.

00:15:00.958 --> 00:15:04.460
You can't be complacent
and step into the fullness

00:15:04.460 --> 00:15:06.477
of what God has in store.

00:15:06.477 --> 00:15:10.172
The amplified version
says, it's a critical time.

00:15:10.172 --> 00:15:13.689
It stresses the importance of the season.

00:15:13.689 --> 00:15:16.162
It's saying, don't take it lightly,

00:15:16.162 --> 00:15:19.325
don't dismiss and say aw,
this isn't for me today.

00:15:19.325 --> 00:15:21.780
If you don't stir your faith up,

00:15:21.780 --> 00:15:24.957
you can miss the new
things God wants to do.

00:15:24.957 --> 00:15:29.258
What you're believing for is
not way off in the distance,

00:15:29.258 --> 00:15:33.036
it's close, it's at hand,
it could happen today.

00:15:33.036 --> 00:15:35.844
Live with this expectancy.

00:15:35.844 --> 00:15:38.823
There has to be an
anticipation in your spirit,

00:15:38.823 --> 00:15:41.217
that today could be my day.

00:15:41.217 --> 00:15:45.541
Too many people go around
feeling wrong on the inside.

00:15:45.541 --> 00:15:47.816
They don't really like who they are.

00:15:47.816 --> 00:15:50.770
They focus on their faults, weaknesses.

00:15:50.770 --> 00:15:53.728
They're constantly critical
towards themselves.

00:15:53.728 --> 00:15:56.525
That recording of everything
they've done wrong

00:15:56.525 --> 00:15:58.596
is always playing in their mind.

00:15:58.596 --> 00:16:02.021
You're impatient, you
blew your diet yesterday.

00:16:02.021 --> 00:16:04.360
You lost your temper,
you're still struggling

00:16:04.360 --> 00:16:05.476
with that addiction.

00:16:05.476 --> 00:16:07.485
You should be ashamed of yourself.

00:16:07.485 --> 00:16:09.924
They wonder why they're not happy,

00:16:09.924 --> 00:16:14.803
it's because they have this
war going on, on the inside.

00:16:14.803 --> 00:16:17.357
But you're not supposed to go through life

00:16:17.357 --> 00:16:19.800
feeling wrong about yourself.

00:16:19.800 --> 00:16:21.826
Quit focusing on your faults.

00:16:21.826 --> 00:16:24.664
Quit over-analyzing your weaknesses.

00:16:24.664 --> 00:16:27.260
Quit beating yourself
up because you're not

00:16:27.260 --> 00:16:28.816
where you thought you would be.

00:16:28.816 --> 00:16:31.734
You may have some weaknesses, we all do.

00:16:31.734 --> 00:16:33.535
There may be some areas where you know

00:16:33.535 --> 00:16:37.233
you need to improve, but
being down on yourself

00:16:37.233 --> 00:16:39.421
is not going to help you do better.

00:16:39.421 --> 00:16:42.041
Having that nagging feeling, telling you

00:16:42.041 --> 00:16:44.708
you don't measure up,
God's not pleased with you,

00:16:44.708 --> 00:16:46.140
you'll never get it right.

00:16:46.140 --> 00:16:48.280
It's not going to help you move forward.

00:16:48.280 --> 00:16:50.551
You have to accept yourself

00:16:50.551 --> 00:16:53.237
right where you are, faults and all.

00:16:53.237 --> 00:16:56.049
One of the biggest challenges we all face

00:16:56.049 --> 00:16:59.793
is getting along with people
because everyone is different.

00:16:59.793 --> 00:17:03.458
We have different personalities,
different temperaments,

00:17:03.458 --> 00:17:05.488
we come from different backgrounds.

00:17:05.488 --> 00:17:08.519
When somebody doesn't agree with us or

00:17:08.519 --> 00:17:10.445
they do something we don't like,

00:17:10.445 --> 00:17:12.810
it's easy to get in conflict with them,

00:17:12.810 --> 00:17:17.075
argue, try to straighten
them out, prove our point.

00:17:17.075 --> 00:17:20.573
Before long, we're at
odds, mad at each other,

00:17:20.573 --> 00:17:24.203
living offended, there's
stress, tension in the home.

00:17:24.203 --> 00:17:27.480
What's happened, we've allowed strife in.

00:17:27.480 --> 00:17:31.941
Strife is a spirit, just
like peace is a spirit.

00:17:31.941 --> 00:17:34.110
You've walked into a place before,

00:17:34.110 --> 00:17:36.619
you don't know anybody,
you've never been there,

00:17:36.619 --> 00:17:39.641
but you can feel the tension in the room.

00:17:39.641 --> 00:17:42.770
In the atmosphere there's stress, discord,

00:17:42.770 --> 00:17:46.895
nobody said anything, but you
know something is not right.

00:17:46.895 --> 00:17:49.554
That's the spirit of strife.

00:17:49.554 --> 00:17:52.225
Now if we would see it
as the destructive force

00:17:52.225 --> 00:17:54.990
that it is, we would be more careful

00:17:54.990 --> 00:17:57.706
about allowing it in our lives.

00:17:57.706 --> 00:18:00.812
After all, it's easy to argue,

00:18:00.812 --> 00:18:03.876
especially with those closest to you.

00:18:03.876 --> 00:18:07.374
Let's be real, your spouse
can get on your nerves.

00:18:07.374 --> 00:18:09.932
You love the man, you
can't live without him,

00:18:09.932 --> 00:18:12.421
sometimes you feel like choking him.

00:18:12.421 --> 00:18:14.444
A reporter asked Billy Graham

00:18:14.444 --> 00:18:16.884
if he'd ever thought about divorce.

00:18:16.884 --> 00:18:19.241
He divorce no, but murder, yes.

00:18:19.241 --> 00:18:21.410
(audience laughs)

00:18:21.410 --> 00:18:23.131
But when we let our guard down and

00:18:23.131 --> 00:18:25.112
say things that are hurtful,

00:18:25.112 --> 00:18:28.125
disrespectful, demeaning, that's not only

00:18:28.125 --> 00:18:30.093
damaging the relationship,

00:18:30.093 --> 00:18:32.747
that's opening the door to strife.

00:18:32.747 --> 00:18:36.486
That's inviting that destructive
spirit into our life.

00:18:36.486 --> 00:18:40.755
That's why the scripture says
give no place to the enemy.

00:18:40.755 --> 00:18:43.341
Strife can't just come in when it wants,

00:18:43.341 --> 00:18:46.984
bring division, disharmony,
tear relationships apart.

00:18:46.984 --> 00:18:48.877
We have to open the door.

00:18:48.877 --> 00:18:52.061
And I'm not saying that we
should never have an argument,

00:18:52.061 --> 00:18:55.883
never say a wrong word,
that's not reality.

00:18:55.883 --> 00:18:59.246
But when it comes a part of who we are,

00:18:59.246 --> 00:19:03.172
it becomes common, we're
constantly arguing,

00:19:03.172 --> 00:19:05.407
fighting, being disrespectful,

00:19:05.407 --> 00:19:07.707
that means we've gone way too far.

00:19:07.707 --> 00:19:11.275
It's easy to let the pressures
of life weigh us down.

00:19:11.275 --> 00:19:14.741
We have traffic to deal
with, bills to pay,

00:19:14.741 --> 00:19:16.309
people that are rude.

00:19:16.309 --> 00:19:19.147
If we're not careful, we'll look up and

00:19:19.147 --> 00:19:22.467
we don't smile as much,
we're not as friendly,

00:19:22.467 --> 00:19:25.832
we never laugh, never have fun anymore.

00:19:25.832 --> 00:19:27.533
We have too much pressure,

00:19:27.533 --> 00:19:31.165
too much responsibility to enjoy life,

00:19:31.165 --> 00:19:35.238
but God didn't create you
to live with a heaviness.

00:19:35.238 --> 00:19:37.951
You're not supposed to go around solemn,

00:19:37.951 --> 00:19:41.748
serious all the time,
burdened down by problems.

00:19:41.748 --> 00:19:44.964
Taking time to laugh, to have fun,

00:19:44.964 --> 00:19:49.780
that re-energizes you, it
helps keep you in balance.

00:19:49.780 --> 00:19:53.871
If it's all work, all stress,
all dealing with problems,

00:19:53.871 --> 00:19:55.719
that's going to weigh you down.

00:19:55.719 --> 00:19:58.940
You can get so busy raising your children,

00:19:58.940 --> 00:20:02.038
changing diapers, getting them to school,

00:20:02.038 --> 00:20:04.042
making sure their homework is done

00:20:04.042 --> 00:20:06.346
that you don't enjoy your children.

00:20:06.346 --> 00:20:08.707
It's all work, no time for play.

00:20:08.707 --> 00:20:12.346
And sometimes, we think
we have to be serious

00:20:12.346 --> 00:20:14.431
to show that we're responsible.

00:20:14.431 --> 00:20:17.504
But you can be responsible
and good natured

00:20:17.504 --> 00:20:18.973
at the same time.

00:20:18.973 --> 00:20:21.990
Have you let the pressures
of life weigh you down?

00:20:21.990 --> 00:20:24.974
Are you always solemn, always serious?

00:20:24.974 --> 00:20:27.349
If you don't make this adjustment,

00:20:27.349 --> 00:20:30.026
not only will you not enjoy your life

00:20:30.026 --> 00:20:33.961
to the full, but you won't
have good relationships.

00:20:33.961 --> 00:20:38.251
Nobody wants to be around
a grumpy, sour person.

00:20:38.251 --> 00:20:40.251
That pushes people away.

00:20:43.162 --> 00:20:44.356
- Thank you guys so much for watching.

00:20:44.356 --> 00:20:47.182
I made this video because
Pagla Bye asked me to.

00:20:47.182 --> 00:20:48.549
So if there's a famous entrepreneur that

00:20:48.549 --> 00:20:50.349
you want me to profile
next, check out the link

00:20:50.349 --> 00:20:53.454
in the description and you
can go and cast your vote.

00:20:53.454 --> 00:20:55.111
I'd also love to know what clip resonated

00:20:55.111 --> 00:20:56.961
the most with you, what
lesson are you going to take

00:20:56.961 --> 00:20:59.836
with this video and
immediately apply to your life

00:20:59.836 --> 00:21:01.690
or to your business somehow, leave it down

00:21:01.690 --> 00:21:03.109
in the comments below, I'm really curious

00:21:03.109 --> 00:21:05.083
to find out what you have to say.

00:21:05.083 --> 00:21:07.250
I also want to give a quick
shout out to Surge Wisdom.

00:21:07.250 --> 00:21:09.064
Surge Wisdom thank you so much

00:21:09.064 --> 00:21:10.962
for picking up a copy of
my book, Your One Word,

00:21:10.962 --> 00:21:14.118
and making multiple videos
on your YouTube channel

00:21:14.118 --> 00:21:16.533
covering all the different
chapters in my book.

00:21:16.533 --> 00:21:18.216
Thank you so much man for the support

00:21:18.216 --> 00:21:20.884
and I'm so glad that you enjoyed my book.

00:21:20.884 --> 00:21:23.384
(light music)

00:21:32.846 --> 00:21:34.252
Thank you guys so much for watching,

00:21:34.252 --> 00:21:36.686
I believe in you, I hope you continue to

00:21:36.686 --> 00:21:39.902
believe in yourself and
whatever your one word is

00:21:39.902 --> 00:21:42.543
much love, I'll see you soon.

00:21:42.543 --> 00:21:45.626
(boom and jet sound)

00:21:48.432 --> 00:21:52.122
- But living guilty doesn't
do anything productive.

00:21:52.122 --> 00:21:54.031
It doesn't help you to do better,

00:21:54.031 --> 00:21:56.258
it causes you to struggle more.

00:21:56.258 --> 00:21:59.506
Guilt drains you emotionally, physically

00:21:59.506 --> 00:22:01.245
it will wear you out.

00:22:01.245 --> 00:22:04.168
When we're guilty, we don't pursue dreams,

00:22:04.168 --> 00:22:07.937
we don't believe to overcome
challenges, we get stuck.

00:22:07.937 --> 00:22:12.063
This is why the enemy works
overtime in this area.

00:22:12.063 --> 00:22:16.494
He knows guilt will keep
you from your destiny.

00:22:16.494 --> 00:22:19.066
There's nothing he would love any more

00:22:19.066 --> 00:22:22.757
than for you to go through
life against yourself,

00:22:22.757 --> 00:22:25.794
focused on your failures,
feeling unworthy.

00:22:25.794 --> 00:22:28.577
You can't drag yesterday's failures

00:22:28.577 --> 00:22:31.413
into today and live in victory.

00:22:31.413 --> 00:22:32.579
Let it go.

00:22:32.579 --> 00:22:35.431
God's mercies are fresh every morning.

00:22:35.431 --> 00:22:39.031
Don't spend another
minute down on yourself,

00:22:39.031 --> 00:22:40.626
living in regrets.

00:22:40.626 --> 00:22:44.665
When those voices remind you
of everything you're not,

00:22:44.665 --> 00:22:48.613
one of the best things you
can say is I am righteous,

00:22:48.613 --> 00:22:52.776
I am holy, I am blameless, I am honorable.

00:22:52.776 --> 00:22:56.631
Everything in your mind
will say, no you're not.

00:22:56.631 --> 00:22:58.927
You have an addiction, you keep giving in

00:22:58.927 --> 00:23:02.413
to the temptation, you
made those mistakes.

00:23:02.413 --> 00:23:05.296
But when you declare I am righteous,

00:23:05.296 --> 00:23:07.895
you are announcing to every force

00:23:07.895 --> 00:23:09.656
that's trying to stop you.

00:23:09.656 --> 00:23:11.815
You're announcing to the accuser,

00:23:11.815 --> 00:23:13.969
to the guilt, to the heaviness,

00:23:13.969 --> 00:23:16.742
you don't control my
life, you don't determine

00:23:16.742 --> 00:23:19.837
my destiny, you can't stop my purpose.

00:23:19.837 --> 00:23:23.754
The creator of the
universe made me righteous.

